WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.600
Breathe

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.680
Just... Breathe!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:36.660
Now...

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:38.840
Reach out!

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.440
What do you see?

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:49.460
Light.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:56.440
Darkness.

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:04.440
A balance...

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.720
It's so much bigger...

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:29.720
I only know one truth!

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.340
It's time for the Jedi...

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:40.480
To end!

